VF-I006: ambiguous exposed symbol
Phase: semantic
Location: line 4, column 1
Found: Order
Expected: unique symbol from either Domestic.Types or Partner.Types
Hint:
A symbol exposed into the local namespace must come from exactly one imported module.

Use qualified imports when two modules intentionally export the same name.

Example:
    import Domestic.Orders
    import Partner.Orders
    call Domestic.Orders.load_order(1)
